# Testing Rules

Read `docs/12_TESTING.md` before adding or modifying tests.

## Unit Tests (Vitest)

- Location: `tests/unit/`
- Test: Zod schemas, pure utilities, error mapping functions
- Do NOT test: shadcn primitives, RLS (use SQL/E2E instead)
- Run: `pnpm test`

## E2E Tests (Playwright)

- Location: `tests/e2e/`
- Critical paths: auth, join FCFS, waitlist promotion, admin attendance
- Use test Supabase project or local — **never production**
- Run: `pnpm e2e`

## When to Add Tests

- M16+: required for new validation schemas and critical flows
- Bug fixes: add regression test
- Do not add trivial tests that assert obvious behavior

## Accessibility

- Use `@axe-core/playwright` on login, public event, dashboard pages
- Zero critical violations before M18

## CI

- All tests must pass before marking milestone complete (M16+)
- Commands: `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test`

## Manual QA

Every milestone has a manual checklist in `docs/16_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` — complete before commit.
